{{Wireless embedded system |brand=Belkin |model=F9K1009 |revision=v1 |asin= |manuf_country=China |is_manuf=No |manuf=SGE |availability=EoL |fcc_date=04/16/2014 |fcc_id=K7SF9K1009V1 |type=wireless router |pwr_v=12 |pwr_amp=0.5 |pwr_conn=barrel |cpu1_brand=Realtek |cpu1_model= |fla1= |fla1_brand= |fla1_model= |ram1= |ram1_brand= |ram1_model= |jtag=probably |serial=yes,, internal,, 4-pin header,, 3.3V TTL |wi1_chip1_brand=Realtek |wi1_chip1_model=RTL8188RE;RTl8188RE, DBF87P1 GD47; |wi1_802dot11_protocols=bgn |wi1_ant_conn=none |wi1_txchains=1 |wi1_rxchains=1 |wi1_sstreams=1 |eth_cpu=true |sw_cpu=true |lan_speed=100M |lan_ports=4 |wan_speed=100M |wan_ports=1 |addl_chips= |flags= |stock_boot= |stock_os= |tp_firmware= |802dot11_protocols=bgn |default_ssid=belkin.XXX |default_ssid_regex=^belkin.[a-fA-F0-9]{3}$ |default_ip=192.168.2.1 |default_user= |default_pass= |oui=08:86:3B |oui_eth=08:86:3B }} {{TagLine|Wireless N150 Router}}
"AP699E9NL"<......>" and "REV"<..>"1.0" kind of looks like it's silkscreened :on the board in the FCC photos. .. but the photo quality is terrible. The OUI used (08:86:3B) is per the sample label. The SSID format would seem :to be ''belkin.XXX'', but the pattern of the last 3 characters is not known. Default settings are per the FCC manual + sample label.
===Probable included PSU(s)=== The power supply shown in the FCC photos is a '''[[SGE]]''' :(''Shenzhen Gongjin Electronics'') S05A12-120A050-P4.
